H("871.d.6.A",3,"A driver refuses to falsify a logbook even though his dispatcher suggests it, because doing so would be dishonest and illegal. He is examining:","workplace ethical and legal responsibilities",["personal preferences","dress codes","pay rates"],"Ethics and law guide behavior.")
H("871.d.6.A",4,"Which action best shows ethical responsibility on the job?","reporting a safety defect rather than hiding it",["hiding the defect","blaming a coworker","skipping the report"],"Honesty protects safety.")
H("871.d.6.B",3,"A new dispatcher greets callers politely, says 'please' and 'thank you,' and lets others finish speaking. She is using:","proper etiquette",["rude habits","slang only","interruptions"],"Etiquette shows respect.")
H("871.d.6.B",4,"Good business etiquette on a phone call includes:","identifying yourself and speaking courteously",["answering with a grunt","hanging up abruptly","talking over the caller"],"Courtesy builds trust.")
H("871.d.6.C",3,"A bus driver wears a clean uniform, keeps hair tidy and gets enough rest before a shift. This shows:","appropriate personal appearance and health habits",["poor grooming","ignoring rest","careless dress"],"Appearance and health matter.")
H("871.d.6.C",4,"Why are healthy habits such as sleep and hydration especially important for professional drivers?","they keep reaction time and alertness high",["they reduce paperwork","they raise fuel prices","they shorten routes"],"Alertness prevents crashes.")
H("871.d.6.D",3,"An employee writes a clear email to a customer about a delay and then calls a coworker to coordinate a fix. She is practicing:","written and oral communication in formal and informal situations",["silence only","avoidance","confusion"],"Both modes matter.")
H("871.d.6.D",4,"A formal business letter about a shipment claim should include:","the date, the shipment details, a clear request and a polite close",["jokes and slang","no details","only a drawing"],"Formal writing is complete and polite.")
