H("871.d.8.C",3,"A planner records the number of vehicles passing an intersection each hour in a table and plots the counts on a bar graph. She is:","collecting and organizing data in tables and graphs",["avoiding data","guessing numbers","hiding counts"],"Tables and graphs organize data.")
H("871.d.8.C",4,"Which display best shows how a bus route's ridership changes over a week?","a line graph with days on the horizontal axis",["a pie chart of unrelated items","a blank grid","a map only"],"Line graphs show change over time.")
H("871.d.8.D",3,"A chart shows accidents drop sharply after a new speed limit sign was installed. An analyst concludes that:","the sign may have contributed to fewer accidents, and further data should confirm it",["signs always cause crashes","nothing changed","data is useless"],"Interpret trends with caution.")
H("871.d.8.D",4,"A table shows delivery times of 30, 32, 31, 90 and 29 minutes. The 90-minute time is best described as:","an outlier worth investigating",["the typical time","an error to ignore always","the average"],"Outliers need review.")
H("871.d.9.A",3,"A dispatcher uses fleet management software to assign routes, emails drivers updates and checks a traffic website. These are:","management, email and Internet applications used in transportation",["unrelated tools","hand tools","office furniture"],"Software supports operations.")
H("871.d.9.A",4,"Route-planning software helps a delivery company to:","reduce miles driven and delivery times",["increase delays","raise costs","avoid customers"],"Software optimizes routes.")
H("871.d.9.B",3,"An analyst writes a report, tracks shipments in a spreadsheet, stores customer data in a database and builds slides for a meeting. She is using:","word-processing, database, spreadsheet and presentation software",["only a calculator","no software","only paper"],"Office software types.")
H("871.d.9.B",4,"Which software is best for calculating the total cost of fuel across a fleet?","a spreadsheet",["a slide show","an email program","a photo editor"],"Spreadsheets calculate.")
H("871.d.9.C",3,"A logistics team meets over a video call and edits a shared route plan at the same time from different cities. These tools are:","collaborative, groupware and virtual meeting software",["isolated tools","paper tools","hand tools"],"Collaboration software connects teams.")
H("871.d.9.C",4,"A benefit of virtual meeting software for a national shipping firm is that it:","allows teams in different places to confer without traveling",["requires travel","slows communication","blocks sharing"],"Reduces travel.")
H("871.d.9.D",3,"A map layer shows delivery stops, a satellite system finds the truck's exact location and a tracker follows cargo in transit. These are:","GIS, GPS and tracking technologies",["manual guesses","weather vanes","paper maps only"],"Geospatial technologies.")
H("871.d.9.D",4,"A GPS device determines a vehicle's position by:","using signals from satellites",["asking nearby drivers","guessing","reading road signs"],"GPS relies on satellites.")
H("871.d.10.A",3,"Before loading a trailer, a worker wears gloves, lifts with his legs and knows the exit routes in case of fire. He is following:","safe work practices and emergency procedures",["unsafe habits","random steps","no plan"],"Know safe practices and the plan.")
H("871.d.10.A",4,"If a fuel spill occurs at a depot, the first step in most emergency procedures is to:","alert others and keep people away from the area",["ignore it","light a flame","walk through it"],"Protect people first.")
