H("871.d.10.D",4,"A high-visibility vest helps a ramp worker by:","making the worker easy for drivers to see",["adding warmth only","blocking sound","making work slower"],"Visibility prevents struck-by accidents.")
H("871.d.10.E",3,"A safety committee walks a warehouse yard, notes blocked exits and cracked pavement and updates the site safety plan. This is:","evaluating worksite safety areas and plans",["avoiding inspection","ignoring problems","painting a sign"],"Walkthroughs find hazards.")
H("871.d.10.E",4,"After an evaluation of a worksite finds a blocked exit, the safety team should:","correct the hazard and update the plan",["ignore it","wait a year","hide it"],"Fix hazards promptly.")
